<title>SPAIN: Spain's new electric framework due Saturday - report.</title>
<headline>Spain's new electric framework due Saturday - report.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The signing of Spain's new electric framework could take place on Saturday in Barcelona, Spanish news agency EFE quoted government spokesman Miguel Angel Rodriguez as saying.</p>
<p>Rodriguez told journalists that the government had received a report from Industry Minister Josep Pique on the new framework on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new framework will make possible cuts in electric tariffs.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
